    {
      "source": "Returns an instance of <a href=\"ArrayColumns.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>ArrayColumns</code></a> indicating that array-typed columns are supported using\n<code>Object[]</code>.",
